OL,3,GNEWSATate Liverpool to reopen in autumn
OL,4,A2027                                   
OL,6,FTate Liverpool is expected to reopen in
OL,7,Fautumn 2027 after a #30m               
OL,8,Ftransformation.                        
OL,10,FThe gallery at Royal Albert Dock closed
OL,11,Fin October 2023 for a major            
OL,12,Fredevelopment project. It had          
OL,13,Foriginally been due to reopen in 2025, 
OL,14,Fbut funding delays pushed back the     
OL,15,Ftimetable.                             
OL,17,FTate Liverpool said its reopening      
OL,18,Fprogramme would begin with a major     
OL,19,Fsurrealism exhibition featuring works  
OL,20,Fby Salvador Dali, Eileen Agar and Man  
OL,21,FRay.                                   
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
