OL,3,GNEWSATate Liverpool to reopen in autumn
OL,4,A2027                                   
OL,6,FThe exhibition will echo the gallery's 
OL,7,Finaugural show in May 1988, when works 
OL,8,Ffrom Tate's surrealist collection were 
OL,9,Fthe first to go on display at the      
OL,10,Fvenue.                                 
